   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Hannah. You're verified.\n\n**Order #6101, Saffron Lane:** The delivery log matches what you said. The order was promised for 6:00 PM and handed to you at 6:50 PM, 50 minutes late. For deliveries 45 minutes or more late, we give account credit worth 20% of the food subtotal. Your subtotal was $60.00, so I've added **$12.00 in Forkful credit** to your account. It's ready to use on your next order. Late-delivery compensation is always account credit, not a refund to your card.\n\nWhat's the next order you'd like to go through?"
