   "text": "I'm sorry you got a beef burger when you ordered a veggie one. I've confirmed the order was delivered last night at 7:40 PM, so you reported it in time, and Burger Barn has no open incidents.\n\n**Order #6102, Burger Barn:** I've refunded **$11.00**, the price of the veggie burger, to your Visa ending 4242. It should arrive in 3\u20135 business days.\n\nI sent this as a card refund instead of credit because of a limit on credit. Standard accounts can get up to $25 in account credit per conversation. You've already received $17.40 today, so the $13.20 credit option for this item would have gone over that limit.\n\nWhat's the next order?"
